    },
    "Let the hub connect to this computer" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Let the hub connect to this computer"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ハブからこのコンピューターに接続してもらう"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 hub 来连这台电脑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This computer listens on a local port, and the hub connects in using the fingerprint it got when pairing. It suits computers the hub can reach directly: a desktop or server with a fixed address. A laptop that changes networks can't be reached; choose “I connect to the hub”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This computer listens on a local port, and the hub connects in using the fingerprint it got when pairing. It suits computers the hub can reach directly: a desktop or server with a fixed address. A laptop that changes networks can't be reached; choose “I connect to the hub”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このコンピューターがローカルのポートで待ち受け、ハブはペアリング時に受け取ったフィンガープリントを使って接続してきます。固定アドレスのデスクトップやサーバーなど、ハブから直接届くコンピューター向けです。ネットワークが変わるノートパソコンにはハブから届かないため、「自分からハブに接続」を選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台电脑在本机监听一个端口，hub 按配对时拿到的指纹连进来。适合 hub 能直接连到的电脑：固定地址的台式机、服务器。笔记本换网络后 hub 连不到，选「我去连 hub」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now in “The hub connects to me”. The active pairing is still there; no need to pair again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now in “The hub connects to me”. The active pairing is still there; no need to pair again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今は「ハブから接続してもらう」です。アクティブのペアリングは残っているので、ペアリングし直す必要はありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在是「让 hub 来连」。主动模式的配对还在，不用重新配对。"
